          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara'aya aga qaás as muu sleémeero baraá waawuti'iimar'eene, Munguú Danieli kuwa da'ayumiti nee kuwa ilaiwawa/i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
